S164 LRC14 KERNEL HOMOTOPY BOUNDARY-DEFECT LEDGER
==============================================================================
[0] Scope
  Exact regular-open safe components provide kernel-stability radii.
  Isolated threshold-safe points provide boundary-defect atoms.
  Quotients may forget raw runners only after this predicate is retained.

