[4] Tournament Analysis
  vertex sets challenged:
    runners, arcs, kernels, safe components, boundary events,
    endpoint-owner pairs, packet fibers, smoothing defects, proof obligations.
  chosen vertices:
    proof carriers in the kernel-deformation step.
  pairwise observable:
    retention of strict witness, boundary equality, packet labels,
    kernel auditability, formal interval path, and scalar-decoy resistance.
  switch/gauge:
    componentwise majority of the six retention scores; ties follow the
    declared Hamiltonian path.
